Madam Temporary Chairperson, I beg to move- THAT Clause 5 of the Bill be deleted and substituted with the following new clause-- Powers of the Board

5.

(1) The Board shall have all the powers necessary for the proper performance of its functions under this Act and in particular, but without prejudice to the generality of the foregoing, the Board shall have power to- (a) enter into contracts;
